%% title: Site failover with fencing
%% truth_level: REFERENCE_ARCHITECTURE
%% last_verified: 2026-09-28
flowchart LR
  DET[Detect Site A Failure] --> DEC[Declare Incident]
  DEC --> F[Fence Site A Writes]
  F --> P[Promote Site B Data]
  P --> N[Enable App and Network]
  N --> R[Route Traffic to Site B]
  R --> V[Validate Financial Path]
  V --> REC[Reconcile In-flight Payments]
